data: {"answer": "This area is the Staff Corridor & Physical Security zone, guarded by badge readers, CCTV, and a visitor log. You can see policy boards detailing passphrase length, screen-lock minutes for the banquet hall's MFA door, and the SOC extension (2199) for the staff gate to the Lake Pavilion. The department based here is Security (ext. 1100), and systems include CCTV & Video Management, Badge Access Control, and Visitor Management. Exits lead to the Corridor Far End (Server Room Entrance), Bar Inventory & ERP, IT Help Desk, and the Restricted Server Room.", "go": [{"key": "billiard", "en": "IT Help Desk", "zh": "資訊服務台", "base_en": "IT Help Desk", "base_zh": "資訊服務台", "url": "https://livetour.istaging.com/6a1e0bab-b805-4788-935b-97a06a024613?index=6", "tour": "A", "why_en": "Next in the story", "why_zh": "故事的下一站"}], "followups": [{"text": "What does the CCTV & Video Management do?", "en": "What does the CCTV & Video Management do?", "zh": "監視器與錄影系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent tailgating & unauthorised entry?", "en": "How do we prevent tailgating & unauthorised entry?", "zh": "尾隨與未經授權進入要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 19.31, "total_s": 19.33}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "corridor", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "corridor"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.5}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "corridor", "label": "Room", "en": "Corridor", "zh": "走廊"}, {"key": "cctv", "label": "System", "en": "CCTV & Video Management", "zh": "監視器與錄影系統"}, {"key": "access_control", "label": "System", "en": "Badge Access Control", "zh": "門禁系統"}, {"key": "visitor_mgmt", "label": "System", "en": "Visitor Management", "zh": "訪客登記系統"}, {"key": "tailgating", "label": "Threat", "en": "Tailgating & Unauthorised Entry", "zh": "尾隨與未經授權進入"}, {"key": "physical_access", "label": "Control", "en": "Physical Access Control", "zh": "實體門禁"}, {"key": "cctv_monitoring", "label": "Control", "en": "CCTV Monitoring", "zh": "監視器監控"}, {"key": "password_policy", "label": "Control", "en": "Strong Password Policy", "zh": "密碼政策"}, {"key": "visitor_control", "label": "Control", "en": "Visitor Registration & Escort", "zh": "訪客登記與陪同"}], "edges": [{"a": "cctv", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "access_control", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "visitor_mgmt", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "tailgating", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "access_control"}, {"a": "tailgating", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "password_policy", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "physical_access", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "physical_access", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "access_control"}, {"a": "physical_access", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "tailgating"}, {"a": "cctv_monitoring", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "cctv_monitoring", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "tailgating"}, {"a": "visitor_control", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "corridor"}, {"a": "visitor_control", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "tailgating"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Staff Corridor & Physical Security\nWhat it shows: Badge readers, CCTV and the visitor log guard the staff-only area; the policy board here holds the clues for both locked doors: passphrase length and screen-lock minutes for the banquet hall's MFA door, and the SOC's extension (2199) for the staff gate to the Lake Pavilion.\nKey lesson: Don't let anyone follow you through a badge door, and escort visitors.\nDepartment based here: Security (ext. 1100)\nSystems here: CCTV & Video Management, Badge Access Control, Visitor Management\nThreats shown here: Tailgating & Unauthorised Entry\nControls you can see: Physical Access Control, CCTV Monitoring, Strong Password Policy, Visitor Registration & Escort\nProcedures to know: Lost staff badge\nExits: Corridor Far End · Server Room Entrance (called 'Corridor · Far End' in the tour), Bar Inventory & ERP, IT Help Desk, Server Room (Restricted)", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 19.31, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 650, "prompt_s": 2.22, "gen_tokens": 125, "gen_s": 10.14, "tok_per_s": 12.3, "first_token_s": 9.17}}, "state": {}}

